{"seq":2,"slug":"product-sourcing-selection","title":"选品与供应链管理","stage":"DONE","category":"ecommerce","chapterCount":4,"docCount":14,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-sourcing-selection","rating":{"composite":3.97,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.44,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"选品与供应链管理-简介\">选品与供应链管理 简介</h1><p>选品决定电商业务的上限，供应链决定电商业务的下限。本知识库的定位是把&quot;卖什么&quot;和&quot;怎么稳定、低成本地交付&quot;这两件事讲透——从市场需求分析、供应商开发、库存管理一直到供应链战略与数字化，构成贯穿商品全生命周期的供给侧管理体系。</p>\n<p>它不教你怎么开店、怎么投广告、怎么做内容（那是运营与营销的事），而是聚焦在商品和供应链本身：选对品类、找对工厂、控住成本、转好库存、设计好供应链架构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>电商目录下多个 hub 都会触及&quot;商品&quot;&quot;库存&quot;&quot;供应链&quot;等词，但切入视角不同。下表帮你判断某个问题该来本 hub 还是去别处：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>你的问题</th>\n<th>应去的 hub</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>选什么品、找什么供应商、备多少货、供应链怎么设计</td>\n<td><strong>本 hub（选品与供应链管理）</strong></td>\n<td>供给侧全链路决策</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电商有哪些商业模式、平台、单位经济与价值链</td>\n<td><a href=\"../ecommerce-fundamentals/\">电商基础</a></td>\n<td>入门与底层概念，本 hub 的前置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>怎么开店、做 Listing、排促销、管订单与售后</td>\n<td><a href=\"../ecommerce-operations/\">电商运营</a></td>\n<td>需求侧的店铺运营执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指标体系、用户行为、数据仓库与 BI</td>\n<td><a href=\"../ecommerce-data-analytics/\">电商数据分析</a></td>\n<td>数据基础设施，本 hub 的工具底座</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仓储作业、最后一公里、逆向物流的物流专业细节</td>\n<td><a href=\"../ecommerce-logistics/\">电商物流</a></td>\n<td>物流专业视角，本 hub 库存章的下游</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨境合规、海外仓、多市场战略、AI 驱动运营</td>\n<td><a href=\"../../global-ecommerce/global-strategy-trends/\">跨境电商</a></td>\n<td>出海与跨境视角，本 hub 的全球化延伸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>供应商谈判的通用方法、合同博弈、跨文化沟通</td>\n<td><a href=\"../../negotiation-communication/negotiation-theory/\">谈判与沟通</a></td>\n<td>谈判理论本身，本 hub 谈判章的方法论源头</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>简单记：<strong>本 hub 管供给侧（选品 → 供应商 → 库存 → 供应链）</strong>，运营/数据/物流 hub 各管一段下游执行，跨境 hub 是出海版本，谈判 hub 提供方法论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内容结构\">内容结构</h2><p>第 1 章<strong>选品方法论</strong>：从市场需求挖掘、数据工具、趋势预测到品类竞争评估，建立数据驱动的选品决策流程，回答&quot;卖什么&quot;。</p>\n<p>第 2 章<strong>供应商管理</strong>：供应商开发、谈判、质量控制与长期关系维护的全流程，回答&quot;从哪里来、如何控品质&quot;。</p>\n<p>第 3 章<strong>库存管理</strong>：库存规划与需求预测、仓储运营、库存优化，在缺货与积压之间找平衡，回答&quot;怎么存、怎么发&quot;。</p>\n<p>第 4 章<strong>供应链战略</strong>：供应链架构设计、柔性/敏捷供应链、数字化转型，从战略高度构建长期竞争力，回答&quot;如何系统化升级&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径-分人群\">推荐学习路径（分人群）</h2><ul>\n<li><p><strong>电商创业者 / 个人卖家（从 0 起步）</strong>：先读 <a href=\"../ecommerce-fundamentals/\">电商基础</a> 建立全局认知 → 第 1 章选品 → 第 2 章前两节（供应商开发、谈判）→ 第 3 章第 1 节库存规划。先把&quot;选对品、找对厂、备好货&quot;跑通，第 4 章供应链战略等业务上规模后再读。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>已有运营经验、想提升选品精准度的中级卖家</strong>：直接从第 1 章第 1、3、4 节（需求分析、趋势、品类评估）切入 → 第 2 章质量控制与供应商关系 → 第 3 章全章（重点 ABC 分类与周转优化）。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>供应链 / 采购岗从业者</strong>：可跳过第 1 章，重点读第 2 章（供应商评估与 SRM）→ 第 3 章（安全库存、需求预测）→ 第 4 章全章（架构设计、柔性供应链、数字化）。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>产品经理 / 创业团队负责人（建认知体系）</strong>：按 1 → 2 → 3 → 4 顺序通读，重点关注每章的决策矩阵与战略章节，建立从选品到供应链的完整管理框架。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>基础电商概念</strong>：平台规则、FBA/FBM、客单价与佣金等。不熟悉请先看 <a href=\"../ecommerce-fundamentals/\">电商基础</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>基本财务素养</strong>：能看懂利润率、ROI、现金流等概念（本库的利润测算与库存资金规划会用到），可参考 <a href=\"../ecommerce-fundamentals/ecommerce-economics/unit-economics\">电商单位经济模型</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>基础数据分析能力</strong>：会用电子表格做筛选、加权求和与简单建模即可，无需统计学背景；需求预测的进阶模型在 <a href=\"../../data-science/time-series-analysis/\">数据科学·时间序列分析</a> 中另有展开。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>实际业务中这四个环节相互关联——选品决定供应商需求、供应商能力影响库存策略、库存表现反馈到供应链架构。建议结合自身业务阶段交叉参考，而非线性割裂地看。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"product-research","title":"选品方法论","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-sourcing-selection/product-research","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"market-demand-analysis","title":"市场需求分析与选品逻辑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-sourcing-selection/product-research/market-demand-analysis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"product-research-tools","title":"选品工具与数据分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-sourcing-selection/product-research/product-research-tools"},{"seq":3,"slug":"trend-prediction","title":"趋势预测与蓝海选品","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-sourcing-selection/product-research/trend-prediction"},{"seq":4,"slug":"category-analysis","title":"品类分析与竞争评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-sourcing-selection/product-research/category-analysis"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"supplier-management","title":"供应商管理","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-sourcing-selection/supplier-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"supplier-sourcing","title":"供应商开发与评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-sourcing-selection/supplier-management/supplier-sourcing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"supplier-negotiation","title":"供应商谈判与合同管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-sourcing-selection/supplier-management/supplier-negotiation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"quality-control","title":"质量控制与验货体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-sourcing-selection/supplier-management/quality-control"},{"seq":4,"slug":"supplier-relationship","title":"供应商关系与长期合作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-sourcing-selection/supplier-management/supplier-relationship"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"inventory-management","title":"库存管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-sourcing-selection/inventory-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"inventory-planning","title":"库存规划与需求预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-sourcing-selection/inventory-management/inventory-planning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"warehouse-operations","title":"仓储运营与管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-sourcing-selection/inventory-management/warehouse-operations"},{"seq":3,"slug":"inventory-optimization","title":"库存优化与周转提升","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-sourcing-selection/inventory-management/inventory-optimization"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"supply-chain-strategy","title":"供应链战略","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-sourcing-selection/supply-chain-strategy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"supply-chain-design","title":"供应链设计与模式选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-sourcing-selection/supply-chain-strategy/supply-chain-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"agile-supply-chain","title":"柔性供应链与快速响应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-sourcing-selection/supply-chain-strategy/agile-supply-chain"},{"seq":3,"slug":"supply-chain-digitization","title":"供应链数字化转型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/product-sourcing-selection/supply-chain-strategy/supply-chain-digitization"}]}]}